{
 "encounter_id": "00976",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good morning, doctor. I'm afraid I have a rather embarrassing problem. I've been noticing bright red blood when I wipe, for about three weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for telling me, it's very common. Is the blood on the paper, in the toilet bowl, or mixed in the stool?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "On the paper, mainly. And a few spots in the bowl. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is there any itching?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, quite a lot of itching, and a sort of soreness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you noticed a lump?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A small lump, just outside, that I can feel when I wash."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it hurt to pass a stool?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, a sharp pain, especially when I'm constipated."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Now, some questions to rule out other things. Any weight loss?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my weight is stable."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any change in your bowel habit, looser or harder than usual, for more than a few weeks?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No change, other than the constipation I've always had."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any black stools?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. They're a normal brown."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any mucus?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No mucus."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pain in the abdomen?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No pain in my tummy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. I developed a rash."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Chronic constipation, and irritable bowel syndrome."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My tonsils, as a child."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Bowel problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father had bowel cancer, in his seventies. My mother has haemorrhoids."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I've never smoked."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two glasses of wine at the weekend."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for a living?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a lorry driver, so I sit all day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your diet?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not much fibre, I'm afraid. Sandwiches, mostly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take two numbers. Blood pressure 134 over 82, pulse 72.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's fine? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine. I'll examine you now. Lie on your left side, knees to chest.",
   "pause": 20.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Like this? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can see a small swelling at the edge of the back passage, soft, a little tender."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's the lump. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the internal examination shows a soft swelling inside, with no hard mass."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Does that mean it's not cancer? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's reassuring, but with your father's history I want to be thorough. Any trouble with your waterworks?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What I think this is, is piles, haemorrhoids. But I can't rule out a small tear, a fissure, as part of the pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What can I do about it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "First, soften the stool. I'd like to start lactulose, 15 ml, twice a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like to start hydrocortisone cream, twice a day, applied after you wash, for a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it messy? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A little. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And because of your father, I'd like to arrange a colonoscopy, and a blood count."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A colonoscopy? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A camera test of the bowel. It's precautionary. I'd also like you to eat more fibre, oats, fruit, vegetables, and drink plenty of water."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll make an effort. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in six weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Six weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
